  "description": "Bowire AsyncAPI discovery source — loads an AsyncAPI 2.x/3.0 document and surfaces its channels as Bowire methods. Calls are dispatched to the matching wire-protocol plugin (MQTT, Kafka, WebSocket, …) via the protocol registry, so AsyncAPI is not a transport itself but the schema-side facade over the transports you already have installed.",
